{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "c9e7490a82f1305510911ef2c8d8ae246c4162f91cb332e89e442725ab088034", "ja": "{$P$}くん、ちょっと大変～！\nSNS見た？　なんだか、すごいことになってるの！", "zh": "{$P$}，有点不得了～！\n你看SNS了吗？总觉得事情变得很严重了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3e9864f8e28ca725aa14153dd4783c3e563e79a43760fbbb91399f10fae1b4f2", "ja": "えっ？　SNS……？　何があったんだ？", "zh": "诶？SNS……？发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "bb6b0738640d51062be5fb753c33851539770c2787507cc6440de07f5aebc5e5", "ja": "この間、着物で街中を歩いたでしょ？\nあの時、写真を撮ってた人がいたみたいで……。", "zh": "前段时间，你穿着和服在街上走过吧？\n听说当时有人拍了照片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "5bf36be9db07a615da7b707f1a41dd00f167edf0e8bb274b048bc1f44a0f2389", "ja": "えっと……ほら、これ見て？\n『必見！　セクシーアイドルの美麗着物姿』ですって！", "zh": "那个……你看，来看看这个？\n上面写着：“必看！性感偶像的绝美和服造型”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1004_p", "source_sha256": "81a46d580b2ecb743b80f716291f08aeda719642f058abd264fbaa18973a30dd", "ja": "この写真は……隠し撮りっぽいな。\nちょっと待っててくれ。", "zh": "这张照片……看起来像是偷拍的。\n请稍等一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fe953f12a2b0640fd31ae7eb626cd199bd3b45a43cd7125a02136e9496574596", "ja": "……お待たせ。さっきのアカウント宛に、\n削除要請を出してきたよ。じきに落ち着くはずだ。", "zh": "……让你久等了。我已经向刚才那个账号\n发去删除要求了。应该很快就会平息下来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "2004e2ba0d5530e72f2fb1bb1ba5ff89c6df4e6d854f4daefa4e010794be49c8", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}くん。\n私は悪い気はしないけど、事務所としては困るものね。", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}。\n我虽然并不觉得反感，但对事务所来说确实挺为难的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1007_p", "source_sha256": "efeed5591f05d48af3f1d4ee086434577553becaae89ee4da505842e9c7ffd66", "ja": "そうだな。一度確認してくれたら、こっちも……。\nとはいえ、莉緒の着物姿、相当目立ってたからな。", "zh": "是啊。要是你能确认一下，我们这边也……  \n不过，莉绪穿和服的样子，确实相当引人注目啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "c009b5c2f2ba8954147696f6a84fd94b27f83d121d592bf027a9d65cf557abc0", "ja": "うふっ、イイ女は着物だって着こなすの♪　でも、\nあふれでる気品と色気は、着物でも隠せなかったわね。", "zh": "呵呵，真正的美女就算穿和服也能穿出风采♪ 不过，浑然天成的气质和魅力，就算穿着和服也藏不住呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1009_p", "source_sha256": "71082a88744acd19fc7ec43ec57270fb8f377cd30536d83ef6bd689c05e28b12", "ja": "確かに。上品なお嬢さんって感じだったから。\nそれで余計に目を引いたんだろうな。", "zh": "确实。因为看起来就是个气质出众的大小姐。\n所以才会格外引人注目吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "2cfde8a7c62af661754733aea40999051095b538b0693f9ea79267ce1ab7e0d3", "ja": "当然よ！　ヨガでしっかり体幹を鍛えてるもの。\n毎日の努力って、こういうところで出るのよね♪", "zh": "那是当然！毕竟我平时都有在练瑜伽好好锻炼核心肌群嘛。\n每天的努力，就是在这种时候体现出来的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "00ce4b8e632bc1a226c124268c8382f7810cacabdef8e24ccc4def5e2ef54287", "ja": "でもよかったわ。{$P$}くんも\n一緒だったし『熱愛発覚！？』って拡散されなくて。", "zh": "不过还好，{$P$}也和我在一起，不然就要被传成“热恋曝光！？”到处扩散了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a69a0b6f452d56b0d016d13a27a70a21697d116dcc5d7c88ae653a3955a1ac0b", "ja": "ははっ、大丈夫だろう。こっちはスーツだったし、\n仕事関係の人って思われたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "哈哈，应该没事吧。毕竟我穿着西装，  \n他们大概会以为我是工作上的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "f2a2fabfc2321db797ac08c955534d5b406f033ad23ac9e6526a569f7112972d", "ja": "えっ！？　着物姿のアイドルと、スーツの男性が\n並んでたら、普通はカップルに見えるものじゃない？", "zh": "诶！？穿着和服的偶像，和穿西装的男性站在一起，正常来说不是会被看成情侣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1014_p", "source_sha256": "332dde012759844e42dcf9531efe2a18302bcc1dd9cbab59e08b54b6f80ce3bd", "ja": "そ、そうか？　まあSNSでは、\nそういう感じでは受け取られてないみたいだけど……。", "zh": "是、是吗？不过在社交平台上，好像并没有被理解成那种关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "cc6049565850556e3f6ffd0c8d35023ca35e54c69ab0001d7aa8c01a288322e2", "ja": "ええ～っ？　「莉緒ちゃんウソだろ！？」とか「莉緒\nロスで会社休みます」とか、そういうコメントは！？", "zh": "诶～！？像“莉绪，真的假的！？”、“因为莉绪不在了，我要请假不上班”之类的评论呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0f06846125161d5e13387487b0a09012e340b1ae6c09f4f093c34c4fa756fd05", "ja": "いや、全然。着物姿を褒めるコメントばかりだな。", "zh": "不，完全没有。全都是夸赞和服装扮的评论。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0663_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "1a36500996854a83c7c57caeea7d75aeabf968576722147dffc313547d0acbf9", "ja": "ううっ。ちょっとは、そういうファンの人がいるかも\nって、期待してたんだけど……もう、納得いかなーい！", "zh": "呜呜。我原本还期待着，说不定会有\n那么一两个粉丝那样的……真是的，太让人无法接受啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
